# kolla-common.yml imports kolla-ansible's own gather-facts.yml, which lives at
# /ansible/gather-facts.yml in the built image and never in this repository, so
# ansible-lint's `ansible-playbook --syntax-check` cannot resolve the import and
# reports internal-error. Ignore just that rule for these files; every other
# rule still applies to them. ansible-lint has no mock_playbooks equivalent to
# its mock_roles/mock_modules, and exclude_paths would drop the files from
# linting entirely.
